    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in the heart of the town centre, this spacious ground floor apartment offers an exceptional opportunity to acquire a conveniently located home within walking distance of every conceivable amenity. With shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, and public transport services all on its doorstep, the property is ideally suited to those seeking a vibrant and accessible lifestyle. The train station is just a two-minute walk away, making it an excellent choice for commuters and investors alike. Internally, the apartment is presented in good condition throughout, with bright and well-proportioned accommodation extending to two generous double bedrooms, a spacious living/dining room, fitted kitchen, and family bathroom. Large windows ensure an abundance of natural light throughout the property, while the ground floor setting provides ease of access. Benefiting from electric heating and a highly sought-after central location, this apartment will appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers, and investors looking for a property in a town centre setting. This property comes with a parking space for added convenience."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nLaminate flooring with hot press providing convenient storage.\n\nLiving Dining Room - \nBright and spacious open-plan living and dining area with laminate flooring and large windows allowing for plenty of natural light. An ideal space for both relaxing and entertaining.\n\nKitchen - \nLocated off the living area, the kitchen is fitted with a range of floor and wall mounted units, complete with tiled flooring and tiled splashback.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nBright and spacious large double bedroom benefiting from large windows and excellent natural light.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nGenerous double bedroom with carpet flooring and ample space for bedroom furniture.\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled bathroom comprising WC, WHB, bath, and overhead shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Ground floor apartment</li><li> Prime town centre location</li><li> Allocated Parking spot </li><li> Train station approximately 2 minutes' walk away</li><li> Two spacious double bedrooms</li><li> Bright and well-proportioned accommodation</li><li> Electric heating</li><li> Close to all local amenities and services</li><li> Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers, and investors</ul>"
      },
